TITLE 1D transport 10 cells 10 shifts with exchange

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial in cells
    pH 7.0
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Ca 1.0
    Cl 2.0

SOLUTION 0 Infilling solution
    pH 7.0
    pe 4
    units mmol/kgw
    Na 1.0
    Cl 1.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -flow_direction forward
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -punch_cells 1
    -punch_frequency 10
END

USER_PRINT
10 PRINT "pe_step10_cell1", PE

END